<HelpTab>
    <FluentText>
        Share a folder to let every staff member see it, for things like menus, posters, price lists and how-to
        guides. They see it under <strong>Shared files</strong> in the menu, and can search, preview and download
        what's in it. They can't upload, rename, move or delete anything.
    </FluentText>

    <HelpSection Title="Sharing a folder">
        <FluentText>
            Select the folder, then turn on <strong>Share with staff</strong> in its details. You can also use
            <strong>Share with staff</strong> in its <strong>⋯</strong> menu. Turn it off the same way.
        </FluentText>
        <FluentText>
            Everything inside a shared folder is shared too, including the folders in it. Shared folders have a
            people icon in the folder tree and a <strong>Shared</strong> badge in the path.
        </FluentText>
        <HelpNote Intent="MessageBarIntent.Info">
            Files at the top level of Files are never shared: put them in a folder and share that.
        </HelpNote>
    </HelpSection>
</HelpTab>
